# Forms, API, Redux

## Forms

- `react-hook-form` + `yup` + `yupResolver` live in `container/.../Hooks.js` only
- Fields: `InputField`, `DropdownField`, `DatePickerField`, `TextareaField`, `RadioField` from `common/formFields`
- Shared regex: `utils/validationRegex.js`
- Dates: store as Date at **local noon** (`utils/dateHelpers.js`). API: `formatDateForApi`. Display: `dd-MM-yyyy`
- Never `toISOString().slice(0, 10)` or `new Date("yyyy-MM-dd")` for calendar days
- Calendar: `react-day-picker@8` only (not v9)

## API

```js
// Apis.js — URLs from endPoints.js only
export const getFooAPI = async (orgId) =>
  doGetApiCall({ url: endPoints.getFoo(orgId) });

// Hooks.js
if (res.message === "Data Found" || res.message === "Success") {
  dispatch(setData(res.details ?? res.Data));
}
```

- Base URL: `process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_API_URL`
- Do not call axios from components or pages
- Token cookie: `prioBankClientToken`. Also: `orgId`, `userBranchId`, `finId`, `beg_date`, `fin_start_date`, `fin_end_date`

## Redux

- One slice per feature in `container/.../*Reducer.js`
- Register in `redux/configureStore.js`
- Read with `useSelector((state) => state.sliceKey…)`
- Do not store full form drafts in Redux unless that feature already does
